# Domain pack: Marketing & Content (Content/SEO, Performance, Brand, Copy)

Pre-filled hints for the XML/compact templates when domain ∈ {Content Marketing/SEO, Performance Marketing, Brand Strategy, Copywriting}.

DOMAIN_ROLE candidates:
- Senior Content Marketing Strategist
- Senior Performance Marketing Lead
- Senior Brand Strategist
- Senior Copywriter / Technical Writer

TONE: "persuasive but specific" (avoid generic marketing fluff)

DEFAULT WRAPPER_TAG: <content_plan>, <campaign_plan>, <brand_positioning>, <copy>

DEFAULT STEPS (adjust per task):
1. Define target audience — segment, JTBD, pain points, channel of discovery.
2. State the value proposition in one sentence.
3. Lay out the content/campaign structure — funnel stage, format, distribution.
4. Provide concrete copy or topic outlines (not just abstractions).
5. Define success metrics and measurement plan.

DEFAULT OUTPUT FORMAT:
- Audience & JTBD
- Positioning statement
- Plan structure (calendar, funnel map, or campaign matrix)
- Concrete deliverables (titles, hooks, ad copy, etc.)
- KPIs & measurement

CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS:
- Avoid generic phrases ("revolutionary", "best-in-class", "synergy").
- Every claim must be backed by either data or a clearly-marked assumption.
- Copy samples must be specific to the audience defined in step 1.
